#: ../../functions/func_delprefix.rst:14
msgid ""
"Deletes the specified prefixes (``prefix1``, ``prefix2``, ...) from the "
"beginning of ``text``. Any number of prefixes can be specified, separated by "
"commas. If no prefix is specified \"A\" and \"The\" are used by default. "
"Note that the matching is case-sensitive. Do not include a trailing space in "
"a prefix, as the space following the prefix is handled automatically."
msgstr ""

